  <section class="mp-section mp-paper" id="qualification">
    <div class="mp-wrap mp-split">
      <div>
        <p class="mp-kicker">Before a meeting goes on your calendar</p>
        <h2>What qualifies a meeting</h2>
        <p>We agree on these four checks with you before calling.</p>
        <ul class="mp-checks">
          <li><strong>Account fit.</strong> Your firm can serve the business and the work it needs.</li>
          <li><strong>Buyer relevance.</strong> The person owns the work or can bring in the right decision-maker.</li>
          <li><strong>Business reason.</strong> The buyer confirms a workload, upcoming project or issue your team can discuss.</li>
          <li><strong>Agreed next step.</strong> The buyer understands the purpose, who should join and what happens next.</li>
        </ul>
        <p>If timing is wrong, we record the next follow-up. If there’s no fit, we record the reason and move on.</p>
        <a class="mp-text-link" href="/b2b-meeting-quality-check/">Use the Free Meeting Quality Check <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
      </div>
