          <div><dt>Reason</dt><dd>Two live mandates are stretching the team’s modelling and comparable-company work.</dd></div>
          <div><dt>Meeting</dt><dd>Review the type of work an outside analyst could take on and the turnaround the team needs.</dd></div>
          <div><dt>Still open</dt><dd>Who approves outside support, the work they can share and the budget for it.</dd></div>
